{
  "uid": "nexovital-tecnico",
  "title": "NexoVital — Métricas técnicas",
  "tags": [
    "nexovital",
    "tecnico"
  ],
  "description": "Escenario O-1 (EP-06.F5.US2). La degradación debe verse en 30 s o menos: Prometheus raspa cada 5 s y el tablero se refresca cada 5 s.",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Estado de componentes",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "nexovital-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "CAÍDO",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "OPERATIVO",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "special",
              "options": {
                "match": "nan",
                "result": {
                  "text": "SIN DATOS",
                  "color": "orange",
                  "index": 2
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "special",
              "options": {
                "match": "null",
                "result": {
                  "text": "SIN DATOS",
                  "color": "orange",
                  "index": 3
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "nexovital-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "up{job=\"nexovital-backend\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Backend {{instancia}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "nexovital-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "min by (componente) (nexovital_componente_disponible)",
          "legendFormat": "{{componente}}",
          "refId": "B",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "description": "Backend: Prometheus logra raspar la instancia (up). base_datos y rabbitmq: el peor estado que reporta cualquier backend vivo (1 = responde, 0 = no). Si todos los backends caen, base_datos y rabbitmq quedan sin datos porque no hay quién los mida."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tiempo de respuesta promedio",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "nexovital-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "nexovital-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (instancia) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_sum{uri!~\"/actuator.*|/ws.*\"}[1m])) / clamp_min(sum by (instancia) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{uri!~\"/actuator.*|/ws.*\"}[1m])), 0.0001)",
          "legendFormat": "promedio {{instancia}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "nexovital-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, instancia) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{uri!~\"/actuator.*|/ws.*\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 {{instancia}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Promedio y p95 de las peticiones HTTP del API en el último minuto, por instancia. Se excluyen /actuator (el raspado de Prometheus) y /ws (el canal en tiempo real, que no es una respuesta del API)."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latencia de eventos en tiempo real (objetivo p95 ≤ 500 ms)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "nexovital-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "nexovital-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, instancia) (rate(nexovital_push_propagacion_seconds_bucket[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 entrega {{instancia}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "nexovital-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (instancia) (rate(nexovital_push_propagacion_seconds_sum[1m])) / clamp_min(sum by (instancia) (rate(nexovital_push_propagacion_seconds_count[1m])), 0.0001)",
          "legendFormat": "promedio entrega {{instancia}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Tiempo desde que una instancia publica un evento hasta que la instancia que lo entrega lo pone en el canal de sus clientes (incluye el salto por RabbitMQ). Métrica nexovital.push.propagacion (H6)."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Usuarios concurrentes (sesiones en tiempo real)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "nexovital-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
